title: "Dose Atlas: geometry-based cranial SRS dose surrogate"
authors:
  - name: "Dose Atlas contributors"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/Kiragroh/dose-atlas"
url: "https://github.com/Kiragroh/dose-atlas"
license: MIT
abstract: "Research software and original trained weights for exploratory geometry-based cranial single-fraction SRS dose estimation and interactive DICOM visualization. DCA, single-isocenter, C-arm/TrueBeam and Brainlab Elements 4.5 development provenance. Includes patient-held-out illustrations with synthetic CT-like backgrounds. Not for treatment planning or clinical decision-making."
keywords:
  - stereotactic radiosurgery
  - dose prediction
  - DICOM
  - research software
